GLOBAL FACTS
------------------------------------------------------------
- Base Bank URL        : https://payments.icici.bank.in/sm/BANKAWAY
- Method               : IWQRYTASKOBJNAME=bay_mc_login&BAY_BANKID=ICI
- Protocol             : HTTPS (POST recommended, GET allowed)
- Currency             : INR only (currently)
- Encryption util      : com.infosys.bankaway.icici.util.EncryptDecryptUtil
- Master key           : Shared by ICICI (per-merchant)
- MD, PID, SPID        : NOT encrypted (sent plain)
- Everything else      : bundled into ES (encrypted string)
- ITC rule             : MUST be UPPERCASE, MUST be unique per txn
- RU rule              : MUST start and end with %22 (URL-encoded quote)
- CG=Y                 : BID returned in callback (allows verification)
- CG=N                 : BID NOT returned (verification not possible)


================================================================
1. REQUEST PARAMETERS (merchant -> ICICI)
================================================================

Parameter | Encrypted | Required | Description
----------|-----------|----------|------------------------------------------
MD        | NO        | YES      | Mode: P = Payment, V = Verification
PID       | NO        | YES      | Payee ID (12 digit, given by ICICI)
SPID      | NO        | YES      | Sub-merchant Payee ID (12 digit)
PRN       | YES (ES)  | YES      | Payment reference number (max 254, alnum)
ITC       | YES (ES)  | YES      | Item/cart code (max 64, alnum, UPPERCASE, unique)
AMT       | YES (ES)  | YES      | Amount with 2 decimals (max 18)
CRN       | YES (ES)  | YES      | Currency code = INR
RU        | YES (ES)  | YES      | Return URL (must start/end with %22)
CG        | YES (ES)  | YES      | Y = confirm online, N = no confirmation
BID       | YES (ES)  | NO       | Only in response (10 digit payment ID)
ES        | YES       | YES      | Encrypted blob of the YES-encrypted params


================================================================
2. RESPONSE PARAMETERS (ICICI -> merchant, inside ES)
================================================================

Parameter | Description
----------|------------------------------------------------------
PRN       | Payment reference number (echo of request)
ITC       | Item code (echo of request)
AMT       | Amount (echo of request)
CRN       | Currency (INR)
PAID      | Y = Success, N = Failure/Cancelled
BID       | 10 digit payment ID (0 if cancelled or CG=N)

Notes:
- Response is delivered inside the ES parameter of the RU.
- Decrypt ES with same master key.
- Structure = key=value&key=value&... (URL-encoded).
- PAID=Y and BID!=0  -> success
- PAID=N or BID=0    -> failure/cancel


