5. ES STRING - PLAIN FORM (before encryption)
================================================================

Field order as documented (bind with & ):

PRN=<PRN>
&ITC=<ITC>
&AMT=<AMT>
&CRN=INR
&RU=%22<RETURN_URL>%22
&CG=Y

Example:
PRN=78945612396325871
&ITC=1023814
