ICICI PAYLOAD FORMATS - FOR DB STORAGE
4 payloads to persist:
  1. WEB REQUEST    (merchant -> ICICI, init)
  2. WEB RESPONSE   (ICICI -> merchant, callback)
  3. VERI REQUEST   (merchant -> ICICI, DV)
  4. VERI RESPONSE  (ICICI -> merchant, DV)
