================================================================
1. WEB REQUEST FORMAT
   (merchant -> ICICI, payment initiation)
================================================================

WHERE IT COMES FROM
------------------------------------------------------------
Merchant builds it, encrypts it, posts it to ICICI.
This is the "ES plaintext" BEFORE encryption.

FIELD ORDER (mandatory - do not reorder)
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN & ITC & AMT & CRN & RU & CG

DELIMITER
------------------------------------------------------------
&  (ampersand)
key=value pairs

FORMAT TEMPLATE
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN=<PRN>&ITC=<ITC>&AMT=<AMT>&CRN=INR&RU=%22<RETURN_URL>%22&CG=Y

FIELD SPEC
------------------------------------------------------------
Key | Length | Type     | Description
----|--------|----------|----------------------------------------
PRN | 254    | Alnum    | Merchant payment reference (unique)
ITC | 64     | Alnum    | Item/cart code (UPPERCASE, unique per txn)
AMT | 18     | Number   | Amount, 2 decimals (e.g. 240.00)
CRN | 3      | Char     | Currency - always INR
RU  | -      | URL      | Return URL, wrapped in %22...%22
CG  | 1      | Char     | Y = confirm online, N = no confirmation

EXAMPLE (plaintext - store this decrypted version)
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN=78945612396325871
&ITC=1023814
&AMT=1.00
&CRN=INR
&RU=%22https://commerce.test.com/commerce/returntotest.jsp?payopt=ICI&redeemgc=n&gcertno=%22
&CG=Y

SINGLE LINE FORMAT
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN=78945612396325871&ITC=1023814&AMT=1.00&CRN=INR&RU=%22https://commerce.test.com/commerce/returntotest.jsp?payopt=ICI&redeemgc=n&gcertno=%22&CG=Y

WHAT TO STORE IN DB
------------------------------------------------------------
Column               | Value
---------------------|-------------------------------------------
request_type         | 'WEB_REQUEST'
request_encrypted    | (full ES encrypted string posted to ICICI)
request_decrypted    | (the plaintext above)
request_url          | https://payments.icici.bank.in/sm/BANKAWAY?...
request_method       | 'POST'
request_timestamp    | current epoch millis
txn_ref_prn          | value of PRN
txn_ref_itc          | value of ITC
txn_amount           | value of AMT
txn_currency         | value of CRN
merchant_id          | value of PID
sub_merchant_id      | value of SPID


================================================================
2. WEB RESPONSE FORMAT
   (ICICI -> merchant, callback on RU)
================================================================

WHERE IT COMES FROM
------------------------------------------------------------
ICICI appends ES to merchant RU. Merchant decrypts ES.
This is the ES plaintext AFTER decryption.

FIELD ORDER (as returned by ICICI)
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN & ITC & AMT & CRN & PAID & BID
  (+ ATRN in some newer API versions - optional)

DELIMITER
------------------------------------------------------------
&  (ampersand)
key=value pairs

SUCCESS FORMAT
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN=<PRN>&ITC=<ITC>&AMT=<AMT>&CRN=INR&PAID=Y&BID=<10-digit>
(+ &ATRN=<ATRN> if newer API)

FAILURE / CANCEL FORMAT
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN=<PRN>&ITC=<ITC>&AMT=<AMT>&CRN=INR&PAID=N&BID=0

FIELD SPEC
------------------------------------------------------------
Key  | Length | Type   | Description
-----|--------|--------|--------------------------------------------
PRN  | 254    | Alnum  | Echo of request PRN
ITC  | 64     | Alnum  | Echo of request ITC
AMT  | 18     | Number | Echo of request AMT
CRN  | 3      | Char   | INR
PAID | 1      | Char   | Y = success, N = failure/cancel
BID  | 10     | Number | Bank Payment ID (0 if PAID=N)
ATRN | -      | Alnum  | Optional - newer API txn ref

EXAMPLE - SUCCESS (plaintext - store decrypted)
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN=78945612396325871&ITC=1023814&AMT=1&CRN=INR&PAID=Y&BID=0125435380
(+ &ATRN=ABCD1234... if newer API)

EXAMPLE - CANCELLED (plaintext - store decrypted)
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN=78945612396325871&ITC=1023814&AMT=1&CRN=INR&PAID=N&BID=0

WHAT TO STORE IN DB
------------------------------------------------------------
Column               | Value
---------------------|-------------------------------------------
request_type         | 'WEB_RESPONSE'
response_encrypted   | (the raw ES param value from callback URL)
response_decrypted   | (the plaintext above)
response_url         | (full callback URL with ES param)
response_method      | 'GET'  (ICICI calls RU via browser GET)
response_timestamp   | current epoch millis
txn_ref_prn          | value of PRN
txn_ref_itc          | value of ITC
txn_amount           | value of AMT
txn_currency         | value of CRN
bank_paid_flag       | value of PAID  (Y / N)
bank_payment_id      | value of BID
bank_atrn            | value of ATRN (if present)


