3. VERI REQUEST FORMAT
   (merchant -> ICICI, Double Verification / DV)
================================================================

WHERE IT COMES FROM
------------------------------------------------------------
Merchant builds it from the web response (BID, PRN, etc.)
and sends it for DV (2nd confirmation with bank).

The document describes a legacy GET verify URL, but your
code uses an encrypted DV request. Both formats provided.

----------------------------------------------------------------
FORMAT A - LEGACY GET (per ICICI doc section 9)
----------------------------------------------------------------

METHOD : GET
ENCRYPTED : NO (plain URL params)
RESPONSE TYPE : HTML ("Your Payment is Successful" / "Not Found")

URL TEMPLATE
------------------------------------------------------------
https://payments.icici.bank.in/sm/BANKAWAY
    ?IWQRYTASKOBJNAME=bay_mc_login
    &BAY_BANKID=ICI
    &MD=V
    &PID=<PID>
    &PRN=<PRN>
    &ITC=<ITC>
    &AMT=<AMT>
    &CRN=INR
    &BID=<BID>

EXAMPLE
------------------------------------------------------------
https://payments.icici.bank.in/sm/BANKAWAY?IWQRYTASKOBJNAME=bay_mc_login&BAY_BANKID=ICI&MD=V&PID=000000000105&PRN=2054g200&ITC=650123&AMT=240.00&CRN=INR&BID=9678543210

FIELD SPEC
------------------------------------------------------------
Key       | Required | Description
----------|----------|----------------------------------------------
MD        | YES      | V (verification)
PID       | YES      | Payee ID
PRN       | YES      | Payment reference
ITC       | YES      | Item code (UPPERCASE)
AMT       | YES      | Amount
CRN       | YES      | INR
BID       | YES      | Bank Payment ID from callback

----------------------------------------------------------------
FORMAT B - NEWER ENCRYPTED DV (matches your code)
----------------------------------------------------------------

METHOD : POST (to ICICI DV endpoint)
ENCRYPTED : YES (using same EncryptDecryptUtil)
DELIMITER inside plaintext : per ICICI - pipe or & (confirm with bank)

PLAINTEXT TEMPLATE (BEFORE encryption)
------------------------------------------------------------
PRN=<PRN>&ITC=<ITC>&AMT=<AMT>&CRN=INR&BID=<BID>&ATRN=<ATRN>
(+ any other mandated fields)

BUILT BY METHOD
------------------------------------------------------------
