request_decrypted     | (plaintext built by processICICIDoubleVerRequest1)
request_url           | (DV endpoint URL)
request_method        | 'GET' (legacy) or 'POST' (newer)
request_timestamp     | current epoch millis
txn_ref_prn           | value of PRN
txn_ref_itc           | value of ITC
