================================================================
4. VERI RESPONSE FORMAT
   (ICICI -> merchant, DV response)
================================================================

WHERE IT COMES FROM
------------------------------------------------------------
ICICI responds to the DV request. Format differs by API version.

----------------------------------------------------------------
FORMAT A - LEGACY HTML (per document)
----------------------------------------------------------------

CONTENT TYPE : HTML
ENCRYPTED : NO
PARSE : substring match

SUCCESS BODY
------------------------------------------------------------
Your Payment is Successful

FAILURE BODY
------------------------------------------------------------
Payment Record Not Found Check the Parameters sent

----------------------------------------------------------------
FORMAT B - NEWER ENCRYPTED JSON (matches your code)
----------------------------------------------------------------

CONTENT TYPE : Encrypted string (decrypt first)
ENCRYPTED : YES
AFTER DECRYPTION : JSON (or URL-decoded JSON)

DECRYPTED SAMPLE (JSON)
------------------------------------------------------------
{
  "atrn":   "ABCD1234567890",
  "prn":    "78945612396325871",
  "bId":    "0125435380",
  "paId":   "0",
  "amount": 1.00
}

FIELD MAPPING
------------------------------------------------------------
JSON key | Type    | Maps to (your DTO)          | Meaning
---------|---------|-----------------------------|----------------------------
atrn     | String  | ICICIDvResponseDto.atrn     | ICICI txn ref
prn      | String  | ICICIDvResponseDto.prn      | Payment reference (echo)
bId      | String  | ICICIDvResponseDto.bId      | Bank Payment ID
paId     | String  | ICICIDvResponseDto.paId     | "0" = success, else fail
amount   | Decimal | ICICIDvResponseDto.amount   | Amount

SUCCESS INDICATOR
------------------------------------------------------------
paId = "0"    -> SUCCESS  (matches OtherInbConstants.ICICI_STATUS_SUCCESS_CONST)

Note: paId semantics differ between web response and DV response:
  Web callback : PAID = "Y" for success, "N" for failure
  DV response  : paId = "0" for success, anything else = failure

WHAT TO STORE IN DB
------------------------------------------------------------
Column                | Value
----------------------|-------------------------------------------
request_type          | 'VERI_RESPONSE'
response_encrypted    | (raw encrypted blob from bank DV response)
response_decrypted    | (decrypted JSON - full string)
response_url          | (DV endpoint URL hit)
response_method       | 'GET' or 'POST'
response_timestamp    | current epoch millis
txn_ref_prn           | value of prn
txn_amount            | value of amount
bank_payment_id       | value of bId
bank_atrn             | value of atrn
bank_paid_flag        | value of paId
dv_status             | SUCCESS if paId == "0" else FAILED


