9. QUICK REFERENCE - FORMAT SUMMARY
================================================================

PAYLOAD           | DELIMITER | ENCRYPTED | SAMPLE KEYS
------------------|-----------|-----------|---------------------------
WEB_REQUEST       | &         | YES (ES)  | PRN,ITC,AMT,CRN,RU,CG
WEB_RESPONSE      | &         | YES (ES)  | PRN,ITC,AMT,CRN,PAID,BID[,ATRN]
VERI_REQUEST      | &         | YES       | PRN,ITC,AMT,CRN,BID[,ATRN]
VERI_RESPONSE     | JSON      | YES       | atrn,prn,bId,paId,amount

SUCCESS INDICATOR
------------------
WEB_RESPONSE : PAID = "Y"
VERI_RESPONSE: paId = "0"

DELIMITER NOTES
------------------
- Web payloads : & (ampersand) key=value pairs
- Veri response: JSON object (after decryption)
- If ICICI changes format, delimiter may become | or ^
  -> verify with bank before first production run


